            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kabala EJAKAIT eoŋ atiar, “Atakanu ainerunet nakaiyeiyea kotuŋa luka Yuda, ka luibojete koYerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.9",
