              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kanuka ŋun ebala kwanata EJAKAIT nuka ituŋa luka Anatot, luemoetc aijarakon, kobalas ebe, “Sirikidwar kokiror loka EJAKAIT, kinyek atwanare kakanikosi.” ",
          "type": "text",
